        "english": "Music composed, conducted and produced by Austin Wintory\r\n\r\nPerformed by the Colorado Symphony\r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\nÁrstíðir – vocals\r\nTaylor Davis – violin\r\n\r\nPeter Hollens – vocals\r\nMalukah – vocals\r\nHolly Sedillos – vocals\r\n\r\nNoah Gladstone – bukkehorn\r\nMike Niemietz – prepared electric guitar\r\nRandin Graves – didgeridoo\r\nAccordion – Austin Wintory\r\n\r\nOrchestrations - Susie Seiter and Austin Wintory\r\nMIDI transcription - M.R. Miller\r\nCopyist – Steven Juliani Music\r\nLibrarian for the Colorado Symphony – Joanne Goble\r\n\r\nScore engineer and mixer – Steve Kempster\r\nProTools digital recordist and music editor – Kevin Globerman\r\nMix assistant – Jeff Gartenbaum\r\nScore implementation – John Watson\r\nAlbum Art: Arnie Jorgensen\r\n\r\nLyrics by Malukah and Austin Wintory\r\nTranslations by Andri Þór Sturluson\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks: the incredible soloists, the musicians of the Colorado Symphony, my extraordinary crew (Susie, Steve, Kevin, Mike, Jeff), Anthony Pierce, Kyle Kamrath, Sarah Kovacs, Amin, my family and Meg.\r\n\r\nAnd finally Stoic Studio for their incredible game design and fearless artistic vision. Onward to chapter 3!",
